WEBVTT

00:02:27.602 --> 00:02:32.148
But there are also some other things
going on underneath the surface,

00:02:32.148 --> 00:02:35.026
reasons that perhaps we are,

00:02:35.026 --> 00:02:36.235
in some ways,

00:02:36.235 --> 00:02:38.613
working at cross-purposes.

00:02:38.946 --> 00:02:40.114
Because for so long

00:02:40.114 --> 00:02:46.078
almost all of us have said
we want desperately to be less busy,

00:02:46.078 --> 00:02:51.125
and yet we keep making choices
that put ourselves in the position

00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:53.419
where we’re just as busy
as we’ve always been.

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.172
What is going on?

00:02:56.631 --> 00:02:59.592
Well, some research
out of Columbia University

00:02:59.592 --> 00:03:01.344
sheds a little bit of light on this.